  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "User journey and control",
      "items": [
        "AppDelegate checks the saved key and screen permission before selection; a missing key opens Settings.",
        "RegionSelector returns a region to AppDelegate, which owns capture, translation, panel updates and cancellation.",
        "A new capture cancels the prior translation. Closing the result panel cancels its request; request IDs reject stale callbacks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Capture and transport",
      "items": [
        "Capture stays within one display, excludes this app, and caps output at 4096 px per side, 8 megapixels and 10 MiB PNG. Encoding runs off the UI actor.",
        "DeepSeek receives the current image plus translation instructions over HTTPS. The configured model is deepseek-flash, image detail is original, and thinking is disabled.",
        "SSE updates are coalesced at roughly 90 ms intervals. Success requires [DONE], finish_reason=stop and nonempty text; stream errors preserve received text."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Local state and scope",
      "items": [
        "SettingsStore owns Keychain and UserDefaults access. The key uses device-only unlocked access with synchronization disabled.",
        "Each translation creates and invalidates an ephemeral URLSession with disk HTTP caching, cookie storage and credential storage disabled.",
        "Runtime overview: AppDelegate and RegionSelector are grouped. Tests, build tooling and UI layout internals are omitted; no local OCR, proxy or translation-history store is part of this path."
      ]
    }
  ]
